{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think with physics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet built on logic and reaction. Move, charge, and connect cores to activate mechanisms that reshape the environment, unlocking paths, powering bridges, and revealing the ruins beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve together or alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a single-player campaign or experience it with a friend. Puzzle Parasite also features a dedicated co-op campaign, built around communication, timing, and shared problem-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built with care</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built with intention. A focused, curated experience where every puzzle is designed to challenge your logic and reward curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven puzzles\u00a0</strong>focused on logic and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo and co-op play</strong>\u00a0including a dedicated two-player campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted levels</strong> designed around cause-and-effect problem solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-based mechanics</strong> that power bridges, platforms, and switches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, first-person interaction</strong>\u00a0no combat, no timers, just logic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965930?t=1762156468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/65aea6fdcc35e61e3fbc1b7f785f3f53fb510e4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762156468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/1090c4a3340f057735f4cd14ccdec445087e90af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762156468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta